hy the user input they were going to a hospital.  You can access the code and wiki pages for the project on Github here.  It was created for the INFO 370 Introduction to Data Science course at the University of Washington by Arihan Jalan, Sarthak Turakhia, Kazunori Kasahara, and Adele Miller.  Disclaimer: Current limitations with this project limit its ability to provide a definitive recommendation to users, so users of it should not rely solely upon our tool when making a decision. For more information on this, see the Assumptions and Limitations of Analysis section.","topics":[],"score":312958,"global_rank":18501},{"name":"altanai/altanai.github.io","owner":"altanai","html_url":"https://github.com/altanai/altanai.github.io","stars":4,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"My CV","topics":[],"score":312838,"global_rank":18527},{"name":"suwebdev/wats3010-skills-1","owner":"suwebdev","html_url":"https://github.com/suwebdev/wats3010-skills-1","stars":0,"forks":49,"watchers":5,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Introduction to setting up semantic structure, layout, and navigation","topics":[],"score":312647,"global_rank":18595},{"name":"kyleliang919/kyleliang919.github.io","owner":"kyleliang919","html_url":"https://github.com/kyleliang919/kyleliang919.github.io","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Home page for Kaizhao","topics":[],"score":312601,"global_rank":18609},{"name":"belfortk/babylon-websocket-demo","owner":"belfortk","html_url":"https://github.com/belfortk/babylon-websocket-demo","stars":9,"forks":2,"watchers":3,"issues":7,"language":"HTML","description":null,"topics":[],"score":312491,"global_rank":18647},{"name":"JasonKessler/fakeout","owner":"JasonKessler","html_url":"https://github.com/JasonKessler/fakeout","stars":7,"forks":5,"watchers":3,"issues":0,"language":"HTML","description":"Kaggle Fake News Dataset Exploration","topics":[],"score":312444,"global_rank":18656},{"name":"ur